0.56: While Orbit is in the yellow/unlocked operation state, double-tap within 450 ms opens Orbit Dev settings. A single tap remains a no-op. Leaving settings with < Back reloads orbit_dev.app.js and returns to the Orbit display.
0.55: Colon blink repaint now copies the actual displayed header background so the colon background always matches the surrounding header colour.
0.54: Stable LCD-only colon blink using a dedicated 1 s timeout chain; battery sampling decoupled to 5 min; charging starts/stops battery blink immediately and in phase with the colon; battery text remains red at 20% or below; all blink timers stop with LCD off.
0.53: LCD-only 1 s colon blink; battery shown as NN%, blinks while charging, red at 20% or below; pole centre dot removed.
0.51: Development snapshot split from Orbit before the first public release.
